+The v0.6.3 replay preserves the upstream mod/restart fixes and RyuNET clock,
+request-form and ping support. External PSN publishers keep their original
+URL/Host requests without RyuNET proofs, inventory headers, retry forms or clock
+updates. The Room panel directs external-backend players to the game lobby;
+it does not interpret RyuNET ping state as a Steam room. HTTP loopback fixtures,
+launcher fixtures and the independent socket-policy matrix cover these boundaries.
+
